{
  "case_id": "RARITY-SYNC-1.21.1",
  "title": "稀有度：客户端真值 + 第 5 档「奇特」与彩虹流动（注册默认档 / 数据组件覆盖档）",
  "version": "1.21.1",
  "target": {
    "type": "feature",
    "ref": "astral-rarity-client-truth-and-bizarre"
  },
  "evidence": [
    "rarity-client-vanilla-component",
    "rarity-client-own-component",
    "rarity-client-registration-default",
    "rarity-client-bizarre-rainbow-spin"
  ],
  "on_fail": "keep_game_running",
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "目的（2026-09-25 用户「试验能否创建彩虹色边框」）：边框与名字染色都是**客户端**行为，前提是客户端手里那件物品的 `Rarity` 是真值。而 `Rarity.CODEC`（StringRepresentable.fromValues）与 `BY_ID`（ByIdMap.continuous）都是 `<clinit>` 里的静态字段初始化器，FML 却把扩展代码插在 `$VALUES=$values()` 之前（RuntimeEnumExtender 第 117-120 行）⇒ 谁先谁后只能实测。\n① `/item replace` 覆盖**原版** `rare`（⚠️ 原版序列化名**不带命名空间**，是 `rare` 而非 `minecraft:rare`）⇒ 验证「数据组件 + 网络同步」这条链本身通不通；\n② 覆盖 `astral_dice:legendary` ⇒ 验证**扩展档位**能否被数据组件携带；\n③ 直接给本模组自带的传奇立牌（注册时 `.rarity(AstralRarities.legendary())`）⇒ 产品实际路径；\n④ 覆盖 `astral_dice:bizarre`（本批新增的第 5 档「奇特」）⇒ ①它能不能同步到客户端（= 客户端钩子能不能认出它）②色环真的在流动（`spin=1`）。\n读数通道 `kubejs_client` ← `client_scripts/astral_rarity_probe.js`。`rgb=` 就是提示框首行的真实颜色；`rb=` 是库函数算出的彩虹边框起始色（本模组客户端钩子用的同一个方法）。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamemode creative",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 700
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/time set noon",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamerule advance_time false",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "① 原版档位经数据组件覆盖：`rare`（AQUA `0x55FFFF`）⇒ 期望 `sn=rare`、`rgb=0055ffff`。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/item replace entity @s weapon.mainhand with minecraft:stone[minecraft:rarity=\"rare\"]",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1600
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "② 自有档位经数据组件覆盖：`astral_dice:legendary` ⇒ 期望 `sn=astral_dice:legendary`、`rgb=00ffc24b`（金）。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/item replace entity @s weapon.mainhand with minecraft:stone[minecraft:rarity=\"astral_dice:legendary\"]",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1600
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "③ 产品实际路径：本模组自带的传奇立牌（注册时设档）⇒ 期望 `item=astral_dice:teru_sign`、`enum=ASTRAL_DICE_LEGENDARY`、`rgb=00ffc24b`。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/item replace entity @s weapon.mainhand with astral_dice:teru_sign",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1800
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "④ 第 5 档「奇特」：`astral_dice:bizarre` ⇒ 期望 `enum=ASTRAL_DICE_BIZARRE`、`sn=astral_dice:bizarre`、基准色 `rgb=006bffa8`，且 `rainbow=1` + `spin=1`（色环随时间推进 ⇒ 提示框边框会流动）。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/item replace entity @s weapon.mainhand with minecraft:stone[minecraft:rarity=\"astral_dice:bizarre\"]",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 2600
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "⑤ 自有「稀有」经数据组件覆盖：`astral_dice:rare` ⇒ 期望 `rgb=0055ffff`（= 原版 RARE 配色；2026-09-25 二次修正）。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/item replace entity @s weapon.mainhand with minecraft:stone[minecraft:rarity=\"astral_dice:rare\"]",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1600
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "⑥ 自有「史诗」：`astral_dice:epic` ⇒ 期望 `rgb=00ff55ff`（= 原版 EPIC 配色）。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/item replace entity @s weapon.mainhand with minecraft:stone[minecraft:rarity=\"astral_dice:epic\"]",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1600
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "⑦ 本次改档的奇特物品（一）：怪力侦探 `sherry_sign` ⇒ 期望 `enum=ASTRAL_DICE_BIZARRE` + `rainbow=1`。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/item replace entity @s weapon.mainhand with astral_dice:sherry_sign",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1800
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "⑧ 本次改档的奇特物品（二）：专属牌 `fu_card` ⇒ 期望 `enum=ASTRAL_DICE_BIZARRE` + `rainbow=1`。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/item replace entity @s weapon.mainhand with astral_dice:fu_card",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1800
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "收尾：清掉测试物品、回到生存（不把测试状态留给用户环境）。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/item replace entity @s weapon.mainhand with minecraft:air",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamemode survival",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 900
    }
  ],
  "asserts": [
    {
      "type": "crash"
    },
    {
      "type": "mixin"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "kubejs_client",
      "scope": "whole",
      "pattern": "AP_CRAR:.*:item=minecraft:stone:enum=RARE:sn=rare:rgb=0055ffff"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "kubejs_client",
      "scope": "whole",
      "pattern": "AP_CRAR:.*:item=minecraft:stone:enum=ASTRAL_DICE_LEGENDARY:sn=astral_dice:legendary:rgb=00ffc24b"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "kubejs_client",
      "scope": "whole",
      "pattern": "AP_CRAR:.*:item=astral_dice:teru_sign:enum=ASTRAL_DICE_LEGENDARY:sn=astral_dice:legendary:rgb=00ffc24b"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "kubejs_client",
      "scope": "whole",
      "pattern": "AP_CRAR:.*:item=minecraft:stone:enum=ASTRAL_DICE_BIZARRE:sn=astral_dice:bizarre:rgb=006bffa8:rainbow=1:.*:spin=1"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "kubejs_client",
      "scope": "whole",
      "pattern": "AP_CRAR:.*:item=minecraft:stone:enum=ASTRAL_DICE_RARE:sn=astral_dice:rare:rgb=0055ffff"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "kubejs_client",
      "scope": "whole",
      "pattern": "AP_CRAR:.*:item=minecraft:stone:enum=ASTRAL_DICE_EPIC:sn=astral_dice:epic:rgb=00ff55ff"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "kubejs_client",
      "scope": "whole",
      "pattern": "AP_CRAR:.*:item=astral_dice:sherry_sign:enum=ASTRAL_DICE_BIZARRE:sn=astral_dice:bizarre:.*:rainbow=1"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "kubejs_client",
      "scope": "whole",
      "pattern": "AP_CRAR:.*:item=astral_dice:fu_card:enum=ASTRAL_DICE_BIZARRE:sn=astral_dice:bizarre:.*:rainbow=1"
    }
  ]
}
